    kind: work_item  # b5c5
    title: "depends_on_manifest collapses same-named deps across monorepo manifests via global flat lookup (no package scoping); 3 edges provably misattributed to wrong package's manifest"  # b5c5
    status: todo_hard  # b5c5
    priority: 1  # b5c5
